nts and toddlers to the water in a fun and loving environment. Parents or caregivers are taught the proper techniques to teach their infants and toddlers how to float, submerge, move in the water and roll over. Classes incorporate songs and activities to meet the swim skill benchmarks. Safety skill benchmarks are designed to educate the parents or caregivers. The Swim School courses for pre-school, youth and adult students","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/sitesv/AG8ngQU5R0L8klA2jPQ9ihoHKuRU3znGBgb9PiUCyIseuwjat4XBOHrsD_-ICuz94inZ31DiwesR9xLgppgx6HE_VR9DJ9GKsfjFsJXc3sYQYT86UrAl7ZCmqE8rZPBBn6wMpB2WKRX-UgYch8oQcMEc7AhPvOTDRoZd4BUWa3v_IB_-aMv3qY8rYKXX4Y9vZNl7pIN4TuW-AabcawQIkpyid1gLM_kf7QVlkGEs=w1280","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":null,"optionIdx":2}]}],"includes":[],"addons":[],"gap":"Prices, hours and eligibility are not copied here yet. We will ask when you request.","cover":"https://sites.google.com/sitesv-images-rt/AMxu72v6t7PjIwHrUFfIob1QT-kXbRk1wRSSHkB0vooNelnXTEocAyFdO6dJ_UF-sgf6ypEwBSVFcBqSyvg6mOJ84okOxp0-0QaHKBNMVYFweEtjxvJhveiZIxmpKeykmvPQFlYWbqvfNSXyGLt6zjJ9PF-ifWPqnVm5K30HhFz5b_s9KiTQJLVJxJklzzF9A8o=w16383","photos":["https://sites.google.com/sitesv-images-rt/AMxu72v6t7PjIwHrUFfIob1QT-kXbRk1wRSSHkB0vooNelnXTEocAyFdO6dJ_UF-sgf6ypEwBSVFcBqSyvg6mOJ84okOxp0-0QaHKBNMVYFweEtjxvJhveiZIxmpKeykmvPQFlYWbqvfNSXyGLt6zjJ9PF-ifWPqnVm5K30HhFz5b_s9KiTQJLVJxJklzzF9A8o=w16383","https://sites.google.com/sitesv-images-rt/AMxu72soURCizn2j0e5ZiITuT2cNCOt3R0In3IV0sQdsK9ep_1s3WGw9hshKd4wyCd4Dh7nRnvp9MYLNyQAQl-M_hpxYaUhbbjXaYvU_6r7C_s2WWvWSwi7f_hnWKABdFEPdlmP01ztrC7FRO0K2gCQmC2P_EppvRPpm4ifE4knrF09tKCpDRuxyXwOP1yyN=w16383","https://sites.google.com/sitesv-images-rt/AMxu72uA94GF4K7xJvNd3ZDkeU-fx3E5W4yOtgHKdtixG9IRU0OpI23BhSzqei2eIKU3XOPnvDtnnF_IG4LEmWmr1lIGQr4hP2tswgQq-gMUpIn-YZ165rEFeOty81F5cJG4InmtOzxAO8BVbIim93hgOL5wA6Zof_OeD-yBJR9_hF_s1NMzeixe3D0jOMCf_gg=w16383","https://sites.google.com/sitesv-images-rt/AMxu72vHikkYRL4hTiZ_fDbxFgQagYheU5565y0i8d89rqAxA8KCAt